{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51849","headline":"子陵山洞（在京山县南六十里，即严子陵隐所也。傍有石室名帝星井，寺曰净安，尝有一星，光芒见井中。昔人赋诗云：） · 无名氏","name":"子陵山洞（在京山县南六十里，即严子陵隐所也。傍有石室名帝星井，寺曰净安，尝有一星，光芒见井中。昔人赋诗云：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩钓台翁，弊屣弃利禄。\n烟溪七里濑，风月一竿竹。\n平生知己谁？故人刘文叔。\n三聘乃肯来，公卿指爲辱。\n高风轻万乘，敢以足加腹。\n居然动天象，下应太史卜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}